    <wpt lat="53.1997400" lon="-1.8822800">
        <name>Parkhouse Hill</name>
        <desc>Parkhouse Hill requires some scrambling, so sure-footedness, a good level of fitness, and a good head for heights are required. At the top, you’re rewarded for the effort with spectacular views all around. </desc>
    </wpt>
